    "about": {
      "items": [
        {
          "items": [
            "Welcome to Inlet Beach Cottage, where unforgettable family memories unfold in a bright, coastal oasis overflowing with charm. Nestled beside the stunning Camp Helen State Park, you’ll enjoy access to Lake Powell's neighborhood dock and a quick stroll to Inlet Beach. Spend days splashing in the resort pool, exploring Rosemary Beach, or adventuring into Panama City Beach. Kids love the lively garage game room, while the spacious loft becomes the perfect hangout for movie nights and laughter.<br><br>LOCATION<br>0.7 miles - Phillips Inlet Beach Access <br>1.3 miles - Inlet Beach Regional Access (Inlet Beach Regional Access has parking, restrooms, and lifeguards (during peak season). It is the largest county beach access and features three dune walkovers and 117 parking spaces. <br>3 minute walk to resort pool<br>Near 30A and Rosemary Beach<br><br>Comfortable Sleeping Arrangements – Sleeps 12 (including infants)<br><br>Main Bedroom (Sleeps 2 on main level)<br>King bed with plush linens<br>Spacious closet + smart TV<br><br>Bedroom 2 (Sleeps 2)<br>Queen bed<br>Smart TV + closet<br><br>Bedroom 3 (Sleeps 4)<br>Queen bed + full over full bunk bed<br>Cozy linens & smart TV<br><br>Living Room (Sleeps 2)<br>Sofa bed<br>Smart TV with Netflix, Disney+, Hulu & more<br><br>Upstairs Loft (Sleeps 2)<br>Sofa bed + Pack n Play<br>Smart TV with Netflix, Disney+, Hulu & more<br><br>Modern Kitchen & Dining<br>Stainless appliances<br>Pots, pans & cooking essentials (toaster, blender, wine glasses)<br>Coffee bar (12 cup drip with coffee)<br>Dining for 6 + bar seating for 3<br><br>Bathrooms<br>Two full bathrooms upstairs (showers only)<br>Walk-in shower + soaking tub in master on main level<br>Half bath on the main level<br>Starter toiletries, towels & basics provided (bring more as needed)<br><br>LIVING AREA<br>Air conditioning & heating<br>Couches and chairs<br>Free WiFi<br>Smart TV<br><br>Outdoor Haven<br>Beach essentials: chairs & toys (please bring your cart and towels)<br>Back deck with gas grill (propane included)<br>Resort pool and neighborhood dock at Lake Powell<br><br>Entertainment & Amenities<br>Smart TVs in every bedroom<br>Game room with arcade game, foosball, & basketball<br>High-speed WiFi + laptop-friendly workspace<br>In-unit washer & dryer<br><br>Safety<br>Smoke alarm & fire extinguisher<br>Exterior cameras at front door, back deck, and side of home for security<br><br>Parking & Layout<br>Driveway fits 3 vehicles<br>Two-story cottage with private backyard<br>Front porch glider; relaxing chairs and table<br><br>CHECK IN<br> * Requirements which include a signed rental agreement, ID verification, and an optional security hold of $1,000 (which is not a traditional security deposit, just a pending transaction). As an optional alternative to the security hold, you may opt in to purchase an optional non-refundable $59 damage waiver provided by a third-party insurance company. This takes place on a separate website not associated with VRBO.<br><br>Your stay at Inlet Beach Cottage promises ultimate comfort, unmatched convenience, and a memorable experience. Book now and enjoy your Inlet Beach adventure in style!<br><br>Book your stay with KirbyAppeal Vacations today and make this trip one to remember!",
            "Our prices include all fees. No hidden fees."
